olor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "nw1mef7cib752qrb", "roundness": null, "seed": 1908847527, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1324597491, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794157960924, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "18 How to read a graph"}, {"id": "78w5n1e0h6wi81np", "type": "text", "x": 2000, "y": 22780, "width": 793.0, "height": 455.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 951897939, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1031973339, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794157960930, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Notes\n\n[19:30 \u00b7 1 min]\nSAY:\nBoxes are datasets or columns. Arrows mean \"used to make\".\n\nFind the target. That's our yellow box.\nEverything above it is upstream. It was made from those.\nEverything below it is downstream. Those were made from it.\n\nThe grey boxes off to the side have no path to the target.\nThose are the safe inputs.\n\nNEXT: there are only three shapes to look for.", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Notes\n\n[19:30 \u00b7 1 min]\nSAY:\nBoxes are datasets or columns. Arrows mean \"used to make\".\n\nFind the target. That's our yellow box.\nEverything above it is upstream. It was made from those.\nEverything below it is downstream. Those were made from it.\n\nThe grey boxes off to the side have no path to the target.\nThose are the safe inputs.\n\nNEXT: there are only three shapes to look for.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ovbzrsda70t9ytk4", "type": "text", "x": 110, "y": 22860, "width": 507.0, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "background