, "text": "Notes\n\n[25:00 \u00b7 1 min]\nSAY:\nStep two: walk it.\nStart at the target. Follow every arrow upstream.\nPoverty: upstream. Out.\nUnemployment: upstream, twice. Out.\nRainfall: no path at all. Safe.\n\n[Point at whoever shouted C.] You were right.\n\nA computer does this walk in milliseconds.\nAnd it finds every route, not only the shortest.\n\nNEXT: the walk gives us one of four answers.", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Notes\n\n[25:00 \u00b7 1 min]\nSAY:\nStep two: walk it.\nStart at the target. Follow every arrow upstream.\nPoverty: upstream. Out.\nUnemployment: upstream, twice. Out.\nRainfall: no path at all. Safe.\n\n[Point at whoever shouted C.] You were right.\n\nA computer does this walk in milliseconds.\nAnd it finds every route, not only the shortest.\n\nNEXT: the walk gives us one of four answers.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "1js5oz4nyldv6n59", "type": "text", "x": 110, "y": 28220, "width": 349.0, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "xb8ust5epn6aq4jh", "roundness": null, "seed": 1137950385, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1192789247, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1794157960956, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2.  Walk it", "fontSize": 64, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2.  Walk it", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "n7n3az7jn76d363a", "type": "rectangle", "x": 250, "y": 28350, "width": 240, "height": 90, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "xb8ust5epn6aq4jh", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 36412906, 